  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "解得 $x = 1.307 \\times 10^{4}$,$y = 1.542 \\times 10^{4}$。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "接触不良颗粒百分比 $= y/(x+y) = 1.542/2.85 = 54.1\\%$。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "给分原则:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "本小问共 8 分:扩散电流正确 3 分,接触电流正确 1 分,颗粒总数正确 1 分,正确列方程组 1 分,正确解方程组 1 分(只要 $y$ 正确就可得 1 分,$y$ 错误不得分),答案 1 分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "若以 $Q_0 = 3.6 \\times 10^{-12} \\, \\mathrm{C}$,$D = 3.0 \\times 10^{3} \\, \\mathrm{nm^2\\,s^{-1}}$,得"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$|I| = \\left| \\frac{\\mathrm{d}Q}{\\mathrm{d}t} \\right| = \\left| \\frac{\\pi^2 D}{4L^2} Q_0 e^{-\\frac{\\pi^2 D}{4L^2} t} \\right|$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$= \\left| \\frac{\\pi^2 \\times 3.00 \\times 10^{3} \\, \\mathrm{nm^2\\,s^{-1}}}{4 \\times (180 \\, \\mathrm{nm})^2} \\times 3.6 \\times 10^{-12} \\, \\mathrm{C} \\times e^{-\\frac{\\pi^2 \\times 3.00 \\times 10^{3} \\, \\mathrm{nm^2\\,s^{-1}}}{4 \\times (180 \\, \\mathrm{nm})^2} \\times 10.00 \\, \\mathrm{s}} \\right|$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$= 0.0837 \\, \\mathrm{pA}$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "若接触电阻 $R = 2.00 \\times 10^{13} \\, \\Omega$,$I_2 = 0.500 \\, \\mathrm{V} / R = 0.0250 \\, \\mathrm{pA}$。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "电极表面 PBA-1 颗粒的总个数:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$N = \\frac{m}{m_L} = \\frac{m}{(L/a)^3 / 2 \\cdot M_r / N_A}$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$= 0.3198 \\times 10^{-9} / \\left( \\left( \\frac{180}{0.510} \\right)^3 / 2 \\times \\frac{306.92}{6.022 \\times 10^{23}} \\right) = 2.85 \\times 10^{4}$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "联立方程组:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$x + y = 2.85 \\times 10^{4}$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$0.0837x + 0.0250y = 1385.76$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "其中 $x$ 为扩散速率控制的颗粒个数,$y$ 为接触电阻控制的颗粒个数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "解得 $x = 1.15 \\times 10^{4}$,$y = 1.70 \\times 10^{4}$。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "接触不良颗粒百分比 $= y/(x+y) = 1.70/2.85 = 59.6\\%$。"
    }
  ]
}
